cff-version: 1.0.10
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DigitalDashboard: An integrated platform for CUSUM-based early warning and geospatial disease surveillance"
abstract: "DigitalDashboard is an integrated R/Shiny application that combines the CUSUM-RAP and Geospatial-RAP workflows in a single interface. It allows users to upload API-Pop-compatible data, apply shared epidemiological and geographic filters, configure CUSUM parameters, and visualise surveillance outputs through early-warning plots, prevalence maps, LISA cluster maps, tables, prepared datasets, and downloadable results. The dashboard supports near real-time monitoring of spatial and temporal patterns in epidemiological data and provides a unified workflow for local public health surveillance and response."
